# Forge configuration
# Copy to .env (or .env.local) and fill in — never commit real keys.

# ── Market data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Twelve Data API key (free at https://twelvedata.com/pricing).
# Enables real OHLC for Spot Gold (XAU/USD).
# Without it, metals show an explicit not-configured unavailable state —
# no proxy instrument is ever substituted.
VITE_TWELVEDATA_API_KEY=

# ── Oracle AI (server-side only — NEVER exposed to the browser) ─────
# These are read from the server environment (Vercel Production etc.).
# The frontend never sees them; /api/oracle/models only reports which
# key NAMES are configured.
#
# AgentRouter — one key, many models. FIRST gateway for Claude/GPT
# entries, so it is the recommended single-key setup.
#AGENTROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: AgentRouter gateway base URL + model override.
#AGENTROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.agentrouter.dev/v1
#AGENTROUTER_MODEL=claude-opus-5
#
# Direct provider keys (used when AgentRouter is not configured):
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
#GEMINI_API_KEY=
#
# Optional per-provider model-id overrides:
#ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
#OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6
#GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-pro
